The onions in the pan look soft now.
I remember the recipe's instructions.
Now it is time for the turmeric.
I add turmeric to the pan.
I know the next step by heart.
I put the poha in the pan.
A lovely smell starts rising from the pan.
I mix all the things nicely together.
The colour of the poha becomes a great yellow.
Now it just needs to steam.
I add the fried peanuts and salt to taste.
I mix everything once more.
I put a lid on the pan.
I wait for two minutes.
The poha gets a good steam.
I remove the lid.
"Finally, add fresh coriander and lemon juice."
I put coriander on the poha.
Then I squeeze half a lemon on it.
The Kande Pohe looks very nice.
The aroma is very great.
Now I wait for Neha and Amit.
